Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:32:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dsa: sparse fp8 prefill kernel prototype (Triton) for small
 head counts under DCP, with torch reference; correct, 6 ms per 4k-token layer
 at K=2048

---
